WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:05.371
(male announcer)
<i> Teaching Center</i>
is brought to you by BMW.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:07.540
The ultimate driving machine.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.543
[upbeat rock music]

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:15.514
♪ ♪

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:17.016 align:end position:100% line:0%
Hello and welcome
to<i> Teaching Center.</i>

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:18.985 align:end position:100% line:0%
I'm Boyd Maxwell,
with today's top stories

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.753 align:end position:100% line:0%
from the exciting world
of teaching.

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:22.522 align:start position:0% line:0%
And I'm Perry Schmidt.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.856
Well, now we know.

00:00:23.956 --> 00:00:25.991
The long awaited announcement
by star English teacher

00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:30.196
Ruby Ruhf has sent teaching fans
across the nation into a frenzy.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.732 line:0%
I've enjoyed my time
in Ohio very much,

00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:36.302 line:0%
but I'm pleased to announce
that I'm taking my talents

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:39.138 line:0%
back to New York City.
Thank you very much.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:42.775
Apparently, PS431 has made Ruby
an offer she couldn't refuse.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:45.244
$80 million guaranteed
over six years,

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:47.213
with another $40 million
in incentives

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.915
based on test scores.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.282
This salary puts her
right up there

00:00:50.382 --> 00:00:52.418
with Rockridge Elementary's
Katie Hope

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:55.155
and William Wu
out of--

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:57.190 align:start size:47% position:53%
Colgate Magnet!

00:00:58.624 --> 00:00:59.892 align:end position:100%
All right, let's take a look
at yesterday's

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:02.628 align:end position:100%
high school teacher draft
from Radio City Music Hall,

00:01:02.728 --> 00:01:03.996
where Central Rapids High,

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:06.799
recipient of the worst
test scores last semester,

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:09.669
made the first pick
that was no surprise to anyone.

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:12.738 line:0%
[all cheering]

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:16.108 line:0%
For the first pick,
Central Rapids High takes...

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:19.412 line:0%
calculus teacher Mike Yoast
from Tulsa Teacher's College.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:20.980 line:0%
[all cheering]

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:24.417 align:end position:100% line:0%
(Key)
And just like that,
you're a millionaire. Ha ha.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.853 align:start position:0%
(Peele)
Mike Yoast
is an unbelievable story,

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:28.687 align:start position:0%
his father living
from paycheck to paycheck

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.155 align:start position:0%
as a humble
pro football player.

00:01:30.255 --> 00:01:31.857 size:84% position:42%
Kid was a natural mathlete.

00:01:31.957 --> 00:01:33.126 align:end position:100%
You know he's gonna buy
his mom a house.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.293
- Oh, you know this.
- Oh, there's no way

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:35.428
- around that.
- [laughs]

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.564 align:end position:100%
You owe your mom.
[laughs]

00:01:40.165 --> 00:01:41.634
(announcer)
Today's highlight of the day
is brought to you

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.437
by the 100% Black Angus Beef
Thickburger

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:47.574
on a fresh-baked bun
from Carl's Jr. and Hardee's.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.844 align:start position:0%
Now it's time
for the highlight of the day.

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:54.480
[rock music]

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.315 align:end position:100%
Star history teacher
Ashley Ferguson has been

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:59.051 size:84% position:58%
running up them test scores
over at Vinz Clortho High.

00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:00.786
- Okay.
- Whoo.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.322 align:end position:100% line:0%
Confederate forces
fired first.

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:06.593 align:end position:100% line:0%
Can anyone tell me
where this battle took place?

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.027 align:start position:0%
Now, look at this.

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:10.096 align:start position:0%
She looks left,
then right,

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.799 align:start position:0%
looks past the students
with their arms up in the air,

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:14.734
- spots Max near the back...
(Key) Whoo.

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:18.003 align:start position:0%
Sees that even though his hand
isn't up, he's engaged.

00:02:18.103 --> 00:02:19.004
Max?

00:02:19.104 --> 00:02:21.006
It was Fort Sumter?

00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:22.008 align:start size:41% position:59%
That's right.

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.542 align:end position:100%
Oh, come on.
See what she did there?

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:25.310 size:84% position:58%
She's bringing a introvert
into the discussion, y'all.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:28.080 align:end position:100%
That's a teacher of the year
play right there.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.882 align:start position:0%
That's right, Boyd.
You know, the confidence gained

00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:31.818 align:start position:0%
by Max by answering
that question correctly

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:34.520 align:start position:0%
will enhance his performance
throughout the rest of the year.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.689 align:end position:100%
No doubt.
Coming up after the break,

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.758 align:end position:100%
Mayfield Prep trades
French teacher Janeane Lowe

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.860 align:end position:100%
to Skyline High
for a head librarian

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.628 align:end position:100%
and two lunch ladies
to be named later.

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:44.897 align:start position:0%
And we'll get the inside scoop
on the impending

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:46.465
- teacher's strike that could...
- Uh-oh.

00:02:46.565 --> 00:02:47.633 align:start position:0%
Cripple the season.

00:02:47.733 --> 00:02:49.668 align:end position:100%
Next up,
on<i> Teaching Center.</i>

00:02:49.768 --> 00:02:50.703 align:start position:0%
Whoo.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.739
[rock music]

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:56.275
[dramatic music]

00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:59.345 line:0%
(Ruby voice-over)
Strength courses through me.

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.814 line:0%
I am velocity.

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:03.583
I am power.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:04.584
[school bell ringing]

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:08.020
♪ ♪

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.791
I am a leader,
a believer.

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:12.859
♪ ♪

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:16.062
I am the force that guides.

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:20.066
♪ ♪

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:23.703
I am the gateway
to what is possible,

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:27.172
the path to the future.

00:03:27.272 --> 00:03:30.309
I am the future.

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:31.877
♪ ♪

00:03:31.977 --> 00:03:35.348
(male announcer)
The all-new 2015 6 Series
is here.

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:37.248
Meet the new Teacher's Pet.

